OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA fine end
OL,6,Fto the day with bright or sunny
OL,7,Fspells. Variable cloud overnight with
OL,8,Fthe best of the clear spells over
OL,9,FShetland. Light east or southeast
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FStaying dry and the cloud
OL,13,Fgenerally well broken with sunny or
OL,14,Fclear skies at times. However, more
OL,15,Fextensive cloud is possible, perhaps a
OL,16,Flittle mist in Orkney at first.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
