OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,6,Fto start Thursday with some bright or
OL,7,Fsunny spells. Turning more unsettled
OL,8,Ffrom Thursday afternoon with
OL,9,Foccasional rain or showers on Friday
OL,10,Fand Saturday. Freshening southeast
OL,11,Fwinds at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
